"},{"p":154,"b":17,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"He was with the Paul Specht orchestra but not at the same time you were."},{"p":154,"b":18,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"It must have been a different time."},{"p":154,"b":19,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Isn't that funny. Okay, you don't know"},{"p":155,"b":0,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Foster Morehouse."},{"p":155,"b":1,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Foster Morehouse..."},{"p":155,"b":2,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Okay, good. You have a sister Louise."},{"p":155,"b":3,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Is she still living?"},{"p":155,"b":4,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":155,"b":5,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Where does she live?"},{"p":155,"b":6,"s":"MR. MOREHOUSE","x":"Philadelphia."},{"p":155,"b":7,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Wynwood, Philadelphia."},{"p":155,"b":8,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Wynwood. What's her last name?"},{"p":155,"b":9,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"She's married to Dr. Austin Smith."},{"p":155,"b":10,"s":"MR. KLINE","x":"Mrs. Austin Smith."},{"p":155,"b":11,"s":"VIRGINIA MOREHOUSE","x":"Mrs. Austin Smith."}]}